u003e\n```\n\n### Needs fix\n\n**iesl-new-website/iesl.github.io** still has the bad script:\n\n```11:11:/Users/dhruveshpatel/Files/IESL/iesl-new-website/iesl.github.io/_includes/scripts/mathjax.html\n  \u003cscript defer src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\n```\n\nReplace with:\n\n```html\n\u003cscript defer src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/polyfill/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\n```\n\nThat matches the [polyfill.io auth-dialog issue](https://roboin.io/article/en/2026/06/02/why-some-sites-show-polyfill-io-dialog/) guidance and the al-folio PR. Switch to Agent mode if you want me to apply the change.","unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"df95d7d9-5113-4e04-8c06-8b712cf3af29","type":1,"text":"can you fix the third one","unifiedMode":2,"modelInfo":{"modelName":"grok-4.5"}},{"bubbleId":"75feae22-c539-48c6-a49d-b8f6b16b3235","type":2,"text":"","thinking":{"text":"Replacing the polyfill.io reference in the iesl-new-website/iesl.github.io site with the Cloudflare CDN URL."},"capabilityType":30,"unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"51bd54a7-99ae-4057-ade4-eb527f8f605d","type":2,"text":"","capabilityType":15,"unifiedMode":2,"toolFormerData":{"tool":38,"name":"edit_file_v2","params":"{\"relativeWorkspacePath\":\"/Users/dhruveshpatel/Files/IESL/iesl-new-website/iesl.github.io/_includes/scripts/mathjax.html\",\"noCodeblock\":true,\"cloudAgentEdit\":false}","result":"{\"beforeContentId\":\"composer.content.55a9bceb58ed710b606429079a813b445665104ceac6792091f9107f1f1525c9\",\"afterContentId\":\"composer.content.a4baf419880fedea81e6f41de2c0cc04607e733869e65cb1369c7d0d86c8b836\"}","status":"completed"}},{"bubbleId":"143a0a99-4e05-4071-8972-1915bf630a61","type":2,"text":"","thinking":{"text":"Fixing the third issue. Checking for other polyfill.io references in the repository."},"capabilityType":30,"unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"956894ef-04b7-4168-b304-f100a8aae2bd","type":2,"text":"","capabilityType":15,"unifiedMode":2,